ARCHITECTURE NOTE — why self-contained: the web ReleaseNotes and ChangelogModal both import the one shared
@/generated/changelog module. On Apple, TeslaSync/modals-dialogs (where ChangelogModal lives) is NOT a member of
any build target (project.yml app/test targets include only Sources, dashboard-widgets, feature-views,
misc-surfaces, shared-surfaces). Per the allowed-files constraint (ReleaseNotes.* only) and the established
per-surface ownership pattern, ReleaseNotes ports its own copy of the changelog data + types rather than
depending on a non-compiled sibling. Data is a faithful 1:1 port of web/src/generated/changelog.ts.

